Specification Shopping Cart

Entity OrderItem 
| Name | Type | Default | Notes |
| Name | String | | | 
| Price | Dollar | $0 | | 
| Count | Integer | 0 | | 
| TotalPrice | Dollar | $0 | |

Entity OrderItemCollection 
| Name | Type | Default | Multiple|  Notes |
| OrderItems | OrderItem | | Yes | | 

